cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, cite its specific archived version and the associated paper when available."
type: software
title: "Benchmarking numerical solvers for the 1-D Richards equation"
authors:
  - family-names: "De la Fuente Cusicanqui"
    given-names: "Juan Pablo"
    affiliation: "School of Engineering, Newcastle University"
  - family-names: "Glenis"
    given-names: "Vassilis"
