    affiliation: "School of Engineering, Newcastle University"
repository-code: "https://github.com/juanpablodelafuente/richards-benchmark"
version: "2.0.0"
abstract: >-
  Numerical implementations and reference solutions for five one-dimensional
  Richards equation benchmarks, including explicit and non-iterative implicit
  schemes, Picard and Newton iterations, the L-scheme and an L/Newton combination.
keywords:
  - Richards equation
  - unsaturated flow
  - numerical benchmarking
  - mass balance
  - L-scheme
